(3314961, 462242, 70369, '<td valign="top">I love this picture and your post processing of it. I''m opening up PS so I can do(try) the same thing to my baby''s nursery picture.</td>', 'I love this picture and your post processing of it. I''m opening up PS so I can do(try) the same thing to my baby''s nursery picture.', '2007-02-01 19:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314965, 456551, 69102, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little off for me, with too much negative space to the right side and the cathedral itself too small in the picture overall. The street, trees, and streetlights in the foreground are distracting as well. Try gettin closer with a wider lens and a longer exposure and you may get something really great.</td>', 'The composition is a little off for me, with too much negative space to the right side and the cathedral itself too small in the picture overall. The street, trees, and streetlights in the foreground are distracting as well. Try gettin closer with a wider lens and a longer exposure and you may get something really great.', '2007-02-01 19:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314966, 462120, 69537, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful model with gorgeous body, great lighting, good pose. What else can go wrong? I hope this will do good in the challenge.</td>', 'Very beautiful model with gorgeous body, great lighting, good pose. What else can go wrong? I hope this will do good in the challenge.', '2007-02-01 19:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
