(3314974, 461775, 69537, '<td valign="top">Good color and nice that you did not overexpose this. <br/> <br/>However, it looks like a snapshot. <br/>If cropped tighter, maybe it might work IMO.</td>', 'Good color and nice that you did not overexpose this.  However, it looks like a snapshot. If cropped tighter, maybe it might work IMO.', '2007-02-01 19:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314977, 452207, 69537, '<td valign="top">That is one cute idea for a baby/toddler portrait. Nice work!</td>', 'That is one cute idea for a baby/toddler portrait. Nice work!', '2007-02-01 19:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314979, 455821, 69102, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice, kenetic shot. Wish the turbine itself was better exposed, but I know getting even the detail that you did get here was probably tricky.</td>', 'This is a very nice, kenetic shot. Wish the turbine itself was better exposed, but I know getting even the detail that you did get here was probably tricky.', '2007-02-01 19:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314980, 460677, 71188, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice colors.', '2007-02-01 19:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314987, 461787, 69102, '<td valign="top">The reflection is interesting, but the bottom third of the shot is really distracting for me. Perhaps a tighter crop?</td>', 'The reflection is interesting, but the bottom third of the shot is really distracting for me. Perhaps a tighter crop?', '2007-02-01 19:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314988, 446216, 69537, '<td valign="top">Or should I say "Come and climb the wall"?</td>', 'Or should I say "Come and climb the wall"?', '2007-02-01 19:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314991, 449323, 69537, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky looks fake. The edges of the peaks are not sharp too. I am not sure if the lower portion is desaturated as the trees are blue at the bottom and then becomes grayish in the middle. It looks confusing.</td>', 'The color of the sky looks fake. The edges of the peaks are not sharp too. I am not sure if the lower portion is desaturated as the trees are blue at the bottom and then becomes grayish in the middle. It looks confusing.', '2007-02-01 19:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3314999, 461988, 69102, '<td valign="top">Great, subtle colors.</td>', 'Great, subtle colors.', '2007-02-01 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315002, 452960, 69537, '<td valign="top">IMO, the huge vignette on the left side towards the lady isn''t that much effective as her skin is already rich chocolate brown. The child''s side, on one hand, is amazing. I am not sure if that vignetting is from post processing or caused by your lens. Other than that, a good entry. Wish you luck.</td>', 'IMO, the huge vignette on the left side towards the lady isn''t that much effective as her skin is already rich chocolate brown. The child''s side, on one hand, is amazing. I am not sure if that vignetting is from post processing or caused by your lens. Other than that, a good entry. Wish you luck.', '2007-02-01 19:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315007, 461831, 69537, '<td valign="top">Overexposed</td>', 'Overexposed', '2007-02-01 19:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315014, 459268, 31829, '<td valign="top">Good timing with the 182 in the foreground.</td>', 'Good timing with the 182 in the foreground.', '2007-02-01 19:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3315024, 458884, 31829, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I''m surprised at the amount of water this time of year.  Is that normal?</td>', 'Very nice.  I''m surprised at the amount of water this time of year.  Is that normal?', '2007-02-01 19:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
