(3318759, 459608, 62318, '<td valign="top">The effect you created here, a watterfal in a flat body of water is amazing. It gives alot of interest to the scene. Given that I think the image is a bit too blue in regards to the white. Maybe change the while balance to "cloudy"? Some might argue about the centralized horizon, but it is fine here since you have other anchors around the photography. Maybe a slight contrast increase, not much. Still a wonderful composed picture with alot of interest. Highly rated.</td>', 'The effect you created here, a watterfal in a flat body of water is amazing. It gives alot of interest to the scene. Given that I think the image is a bit too blue in regards to the white. Maybe change the while balance to "cloudy"? Some might argue about the centralized horizon, but it is fine here since you have other anchors around the photography. Maybe a slight contrast increase, not much. Still a wonderful composed picture with alot of interest. Highly rated.', '2007-02-02 13:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318760, 449368, 40355, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the overall compensation, the few locks of hair across her face under her eye is distracting.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the overall compensation, the few locks of hair across her face under her eye is distracting.', '2007-02-02 13:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3318770, 461910, 62318, '<td valign="top">I like the idea going on there. Though I think the image suffers from either being a bit too wide or you need to get close to those tress in front of you. I do like the varied textures of the tress, moutain, and the nice fluffly clouds. It just seems to be missing anchors to hold the frame together. An average rating from me.</td>', 'I like the idea going on there. Though I think the image suffers from either being a bit too wide or you need to get close to those tress in front of you. I do like the varied textures of the tress, moutain, and the nice fluffly clouds. It just seems to be missing anchors to hold the frame together. An average rating from me.', '2007-02-02 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
