(3322572, 461988, 66353, '<td valign="top">Your tonemapping seems to have generated some halo on the mountains. I believe you have overdone it a bit.</td>', 'Your tonemapping seems to have generated some halo on the mountains. I believe you have overdone it a bit.', '2007-02-03 11:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3322670, 462215, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like how the sunlight adds texture to the ground a lot.  I also love the burst of colors coming from the sun.  The whole scene is really very festive with the onlookers and musicians.  Obviously that wide you can''t control the flares but they''re not too out of place with all the other colors happening.  Maybe would have been good to see the woman a bit more...a more sideways pose.  Overall effect is great. 8</td>', 'I like how the sunlight adds texture to the ground a lot.  I also love the burst of colors coming from the sun.  The whole scene is really very festive with the onlookers and musicians.  Obviously that wide you can''t control the flares but they''re not too out of place with all the other colors happening.  Maybe would have been good to see the woman a bit more...a more sideways pose.  Overall effect is great. 8', '2007-02-03 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3322814, 462072, 68586, '<td valign="top">A handsome rooster. You have captured his colours beautifully, but the lines behind him distract from the picture. As it was advanced editing I wonder whether you could ahve done something to make them less obvious?</td>', 'A handsome rooster. You have captured his colours beautifully, but the lines behind him distract from the picture. As it was advanced editing I wonder whether you could ahve done something to make them less obvious?', '2007-02-03 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
