(3323648, 461831, 62318, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here. The tree has a very interesting structure which I like accented by the back lighting. I think the image is just over-exposed by a stop. Since there is no detail in the tree anyways, might a well make it a full silhoutte. Greens are pretty and the whole thing is nicely composed. Above average from me.</td>', 'I love the idea here. The tree has a very interesting structure which I like accented by the back lighting. I think the image is just over-exposed by a stop. Since there is no detail in the tree anyways, might a well make it a full silhoutte. Greens are pretty and the whole thing is nicely composed. Above average from me.', '2007-02-03 17:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
