(3326458, 459253, 70000, '<td valign="top">The focus is kind of off in this pictures. The vibrant colors of the statue really make a statement in this picture but the rest of the picture just seems destracting.</td>', 'The focus is kind of off in this pictures. The vibrant colors of the statue really make a statement in this picture but the rest of the picture just seems destracting.', '2007-02-04 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
