(3326468, 461440, 70000, '<td valign="top">Haha I just had my first experience with ice all over everything and this reminds me of a picture I took of an iced over leave. The depth of fild here is really nice and the ice seems so just sparkle. I really like it.</td>', 'Haha I just had my first experience with ice all over everything and this reminds me of a picture I took of an iced over leave. The depth of fild here is really nice and the ice seems so just sparkle. I really like it.', '2007-02-04 16:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
