(3328084, 461763, 62187, '<td valign="top">I would have scored your photo much higher if not for the dust spots. Great capture though...and I like the convert and contrast. Nice job on that!</td>', 'I would have scored your photo much higher if not for the dust spots. Great capture though...and I like the convert and contrast. Nice job on that!', '2007-02-04 23:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328098, 456969, 62187, '<td valign="top">Taking a guess and saying this photo was taken by Madison. I saw one very similar in her portfolio - this one is much better. I like the contrast, crop and soft glow still visible in the background. Nice work.</td>', 'Taking a guess and saying this photo was taken by Madison. I saw one very similar in her portfolio - this one is much better. I like the contrast, crop and soft glow still visible in the background. Nice work.', '2007-02-04 23:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328103, 452520, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of a low quality photo to be honest but man, is that harsh environment or what! The impact of the photo makes up for it''s lack of quality. Nice reporting and I sure hope it warms up soon for you...and that poor Cow too!</td>', 'It''s kind of a low quality photo to be honest but man, is that harsh environment or what! The impact of the photo makes up for it''s lack of quality. Nice reporting and I sure hope it warms up soon for you...and that poor Cow too!', '2007-02-04 23:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328109, 460896, 59415, '<td valign="top">OMG lol.</td>', 'OMG lol.', '2007-02-04 23:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328118, 456768, 62187, '<td valign="top">Just got back from watching the game...sorry...I was going for them too. The photo makes up for the loss. Really nice work. If I wanted to knit-pick, I''d say the bright spot in the lower left could have been cloned I believe and it''s probably just my eyes but it looks like the horizon is slightly leaning towards the right - maybe my eyes are just messed up? Too bad for the size we have to post things at, I bet this looks super in a larger size. Nice work.</td>', 'Just got back from watching the game...sorry...I was going for them too. The photo makes up for the loss. Really nice work. If I wanted to knit-pick, I''d say the bright spot in the lower left could have been cloned I believe and it''s probably just my eyes but it looks like the horizon is slightly leaning towards the right - maybe my eyes are just messed up? Too bad for the size we have to post things at, I bet this looks super in a larger size. Nice work.', '2007-02-04 23:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328150, 460944, 69722, '<td valign="top">made me smile.</td>', 'made me smile.', '2007-02-04 23:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328352, 455979, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is perfect except for one thing - the crop. If it were I, I''d have used a more of rule of thirds and put this gentleman whom looks very familiar to me more towards the right-hand side leaving more empty space to the left. I''ll leave you alone now as you wish...after I say good luck. ''Good Luck!</td>', 'I think the photo is perfect except for one thing - the crop. If it were I, I''d have used a more of rule of thirds and put this gentleman whom looks very familiar to me more towards the right-hand side leaving more empty space to the left. I''ll leave you alone now as you wish...after I say good luck. ''Good Luck!', '2007-02-05 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328360, 460807, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like everything about your photo, especially the colors, but, it seems so small.</td>', 'I like everything about your photo, especially the colors, but, it seems so small.', '2007-02-05 00:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328397, 462042, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m giving your photo a 10. The only ''ding'' I could see and it''s just personal taste is your border. I think if you added a small 2-4 pixel border first, then a thinner white border followed lastly by a black border like you have, it may have helped just a tad more. Like I said, it''s great...one of the few 10''s I''ve given out so far after 234 entry views (I''ve not been impressed this free challenge). I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'I''m giving your photo a 10. The only ''ding'' I could see and it''s just personal taste is your border. I think if you added a small 2-4 pixel border first, then a thinner white border followed lastly by a black border like you have, it may have helped just a tad more. Like I said, it''s great...one of the few 10''s I''ve given out so far after 234 entry views (I''ve not been impressed this free challenge). I hope it does well for you.', '2007-02-05 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3328408, 461728, 62187, '<td valign="top">Those doors look so interesting to me...I think a close-up may have improved my score for the photo.</td>', 'Those doors look so interesting to me...I think a close-up may have improved my score for the photo.', '2007-02-05 00:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
