(3331201, 455568, 62318, '<td valign="top">One of my highest rated in the challenge. I really like the mimicry going on here. The light subdued background color with the pop of red really works. The only complaint is maybe the front bird is a little too sharp around the edges, since the bird seems to kind of pop unnatural from the background. Great photo overall and highly rated.</td>', 'One of my highest rated in the challenge. I really like the mimicry going on here. The light subdued background color with the pop of red really works. The only complaint is maybe the front bird is a little too sharp around the edges, since the bird seems to kind of pop unnatural from the background. Great photo overall and highly rated.', '2007-02-05 14:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
