(3331335, 462203, 72714, '<td valign="top">Wow! How lucky that the birds head fell against the blue sky instead of the clouds, or did you engineer it that way? :-) I love the pose! Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Wow! How lucky that the birds head fell against the blue sky instead of the clouds, or did you engineer it that way? :-) I love the pose! Fantastic shot!', '2007-02-05 15:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
