(3331396, 456897, 72714, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh! This is beautiful! I want a house like this.....one day! The interesting foreground and the dramatic sky frame the house perfectly! Well photographed. A definate 10!</td>', 'Oh my gosh! This is beautiful! I want a house like this.....one day! The interesting foreground and the dramatic sky frame the house perfectly! Well photographed. A definate 10!', '2007-02-05 15:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3331476, 461490, 62318, '<td valign="top">Here is what I like about this one, great exposure, great shadows, nice lines. I love the star field and the slight glowing light (sun/city?) in the distance. I think I have seen your shots before, and what gets me is the sharpness, I just think it is too sharp for this resolution. Either that or you are really hitting the defraction limits. It just makes it seem like a 1 megapixel image to me. But beyond that it is a great photo and enjoyable work!</td>', 'Here is what I like about this one, great exposure, great shadows, nice lines. I love the star field and the slight glowing light (sun/city?) in the distance. I think I have seen your shots before, and what gets me is the sharpness, I just think it is too sharp for this resolution. Either that or you are really hitting the defraction limits. It just makes it seem like a 1 megapixel image to me. But beyond that it is a great photo and enjoyable work!', '2007-02-05 15:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3331580, 453194, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - great colors - or non-colors, actually. Good composition. 8</td>', 'Very pretty - great colors - or non-colors, actually. Good composition. 8', '2007-02-05 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
