(3332268, 461903, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot and the colors are nice but I think it would look better if the background were an old barn or something like that that wasn''t quite as busy. It just doesn''t seem to contrast enough with the dark colors of the trees. JMO. I do really like the angle this was shot at. 6</td>', 'This is a nice shot and the colors are nice but I think it would look better if the background were an old barn or something like that that wasn''t quite as busy. It just doesn''t seem to contrast enough with the dark colors of the trees. JMO. I do really like the angle this was shot at. 6', '2007-02-05 19:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332269, 454561, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice closeup and I love the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Very nice closeup and I love the shallow DOF.', '2007-02-05 19:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3332277, 461727, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot and it was very well executed but I''m just tired of seeing this shot. I''m not trying to be nasty but does Oregon have anything else?  I''d love to see other shots from that state.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot and it was very well executed but I''m just tired of seeing this shot. I''m not trying to be nasty but does Oregon have anything else?  I''d love to see other shots from that state.', '2007-02-05 19:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
