(3332304, 448359, 69387, '<td valign="top">I initially gave this a lower score but the image of this man lingered in my head. The flag, the look on his face - the photograph strongly and effetively moves the viewer the more you look at it. Great job. I''m giving you a solid 8! :)</td>', 'I initially gave this a lower score but the image of this man lingered in my head. The flag, the look on his face - the photograph strongly and effetively moves the viewer the more you look at it. Great job. I''m giving you a solid 8! :)', '2007-02-05 19:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
