(3334979, 459784, 10390, '<td valign="top">There''s too much of uninteresting foreground, if the boat would have been closer too you, closer to the bottom of the image, this framing would work better.  On the other hand I like the other part of this image, if you would cut off about 1/3rd from the bottom (maybe have it in square 1:1 format)  with a little bit left of the sea below the boat, the image in whole would improve a lot. Not bad - 6. Good luck.</td>', 'There''s too much of uninteresting foreground, if the boat would have been closer too you, closer to the bottom of the image, this framing would work better.  On the other hand I like the other part of this image, if you would cut off about 1/3rd from the bottom (maybe have it in square 1:1 format)  with a little bit left of the sea below the boat, the image in whole would improve a lot. Not bad - 6. Good luck.', '2007-02-06 13:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334982, 459660, 69368, '<td valign="top">very good composition and lighting</td>', 'very good composition and lighting', '2007-02-06 13:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
