(3335065, 462055, 10390, '<td valign="top">The horizon is too centered for my taste and the color of the ground isn''t in good harmony with the sky.  I really like the sky, it''s very powerful, maybe the darkest part of it could be lighter and maybe the image would be better with more harmony between the color of the ground and the sky. Not bad.</td>', 'The horizon is too centered for my taste and the color of the ground isn''t in good harmony with the sky.  I really like the sky, it''s very powerful, maybe the darkest part of it could be lighter and maybe the image would be better with more harmony between the color of the ground and the sky. Not bad.', '2007-02-06 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
