(3335479, 461616, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a pretty photograph with a fantastic use of shallow depth of field.  I really love htis -- buttttt -- I wonder in advanced editing why the sensor spots were left in ????   But that''s okay, I still love it  :)</td>', 'What a pretty photograph with a fantastic use of shallow depth of field.  I really love htis -- buttttt -- I wonder in advanced editing why the sensor spots were left in ????   But that''s okay, I still love it  :)', '2007-02-06 15:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
