(3335635, 461907, 52439, '<td valign="top">You''ve managed to capture a great atmosphere here.<br/>Well done, some effective dodging and burning techniques.</td>', 'You''ve managed to capture a great atmosphere here.Well done, some effective dodging and burning techniques.', '2007-02-06 16:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335639, 454359, 52439, '<td valign="top">Quite a colourful burst.<br/>Nice crop, and the border actually works with this as the end of the petals have small tints of black in them.</td>', 'Quite a colourful burst.Nice crop, and the border actually works with this as the end of the petals have small tints of black in them.', '2007-02-06 16:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335648, 462203, 52439, '<td valign="top">Incredible sharpness on the subject.<br/>I''d really like to see a full sized version of this shot.</td>', 'Incredible sharpness on the subject.I''d really like to see a full sized version of this shot.', '2007-02-06 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335651, 457865, 52439, '<td valign="top">Impressive. I don''t quite think the composition works 100% though.</td>', 'Impressive. I don''t quite think the composition works 100% though.', '2007-02-06 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335654, 459840, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2007-02-06 16:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335659, 457832, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/>The thing i don''t like is the over zealous vignette, i don''t think it should be so strong right upto the lily, a more subtle gradient leading upto it would have been better i think.<br/>great shot though.</td>', 'Very nice.The thing i don''t like is the over zealous vignette, i don''t think it should be so strong right upto the lily, a more subtle gradient leading upto it would have been better i think.great shot though.', '2007-02-06 16:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335660, 458347, 52439, '<td valign="top">I think the head needs to be looking more towards one side so we can see one of those big eyes nice and clearly.</td>', 'I think the head needs to be looking more towards one side so we can see one of those big eyes nice and clearly.', '2007-02-06 16:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335668, 460793, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very fresh, very nice.<br/> <br/>Nice change rom normal floral shots. I think the subtle pastel colours help, along with the horizontal crop, and the soft focus, to create a nice calm feeling here.</td>', 'Very fresh, very nice. Nice change rom normal floral shots. I think the subtle pastel colours help, along with the horizontal crop, and the soft focus, to create a nice calm feeling here.', '2007-02-06 16:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335683, 461490, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very impressive. It''s pretty obvious this is going to score highly.<br/>However there are some things i don''t like about this, the main being the flat, level horizon running along the center of the composition. If it was slightly lower, or indeed higher it would not feel awkward.<br/>Great capture though, with perfect exposure for the sun from behind the mountain.</td>', 'Very impressive. It''s pretty obvious this is going to score highly.However there are some things i don''t like about this, the main being the flat, level horizon running along the center of the composition. If it was slightly lower, or indeed higher it would not feel awkward.Great capture though, with perfect exposure for the sun from behind the mountain.', '2007-02-06 16:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335689, 462230, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great shot, appropriately titled.<br/>I like this very much, despite having a slightly flat level of contrast, the definition in the subjects eyes manage to compensate by injecting enough impact into the shot. Well cropped aswell.</td>', 'Great shot, appropriately titled.I like this very much, despite having a slightly flat level of contrast, the definition in the subjects eyes manage to compensate by injecting enough impact into the shot. Well cropped aswell.', '2007-02-06 16:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335698, 462121, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Really great.<br/>My favourite aspect of this shot is the contrast between the tack sharp focus on the butterfly and the dreamy, pastel coloured, soft bokeh of the background foilage. It''s fantastically well done.<br/>Whether that''s down to great preparation or fortunate circumstances it''s equally well captured.</td>', 'Very nice. Really great.My favourite aspect of this shot is the contrast between the tack sharp focus on the butterfly and the dreamy, pastel coloured, soft bokeh of the background foilage. It''s fantastically well done.Whether that''s down to great preparation or fortunate circumstances it''s equally well captured.', '2007-02-06 16:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335707, 459811, 52439, '<td valign="top">Really like it.<br/>Plain and simple.</td>', 'Really like it.Plain and simple.', '2007-02-06 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335714, 462167, 52439, '<td valign="top">Good tones, contrast, texture and composition.<br/>Pretty much everythng a decent b+w image needs.</td>', 'Good tones, contrast, texture and composition.Pretty much everythng a decent b+w image needs.', '2007-02-06 16:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335717, 461963, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a cool capture!  Not your typical zoo for sure.   Man those animals are beautiful!  So noble and regal looking!</td>', 'What a cool capture!  Not your typical zoo for sure.   Man those animals are beautiful!  So noble and regal looking!', '2007-02-06 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3335719, 462143, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is an impressive shot right there!<br/>Great focus and emphasis on the eyes, the sharp details on the whole face allow you to get lost in there.</td>', 'Wow, that is an impressive shot right there!Great focus and emphasis on the eyes, the sharp details on the whole face allow you to get lost in there.', '2007-02-06 16:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
