(3337199, 462015, 18367, '<td valign="top">I do really like the mood shown in this image...the ominous impending storm... the  harshness of the land...all of these combine to make this a very nice image. I would be interested to know what lens you used in this instance as I get the impression you might have used a wide angle, unless of course the slant of the walls is caused by some optical illusion. An 8 from me...Good luck.</td>', 'I do really like the mood shown in this image...the ominous impending storm... the  harshness of the land...all of these combine to make this a very nice image. I would be interested to know what lens you used in this instance as I get the impression you might have used a wide angle, unless of course the slant of the walls is caused by some optical illusion. An 8 from me...Good luck.', '2007-02-06 23:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
