(3340609, 456868, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like how the sled is so small in the frame, and I like the pop of red color against the bluey snow shadows.  Maybe if the sled were a little bit lower, I''d like it even more.  Also I think that maybe you could have played a bit more with the idea of the tracks leading to the sled.  Right now those lines lead out of the picture.  It would have been nice IMO if they had come from the opposite corner and meandered slowly to the sled.</td>', 'I like how the sled is so small in the frame, and I like the pop of red color against the bluey snow shadows.  Maybe if the sled were a little bit lower, I''d like it even more.  Also I think that maybe you could have played a bit more with the idea of the tracks leading to the sled.  Right now those lines lead out of the picture.  It would have been nice IMO if they had come from the opposite corner and meandered slowly to the sled.', '2007-02-07 16:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3340637, 462066, 44453, '<td valign="top">thats really going to offend some people - just like good art should.  Congratulations on a provocative image.</td>', 'thats really going to offend some people - just like good art should.  Congratulations on a provocative image.', '2007-02-07 16:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
