(3342043, 461292, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow. this is right on the edge of how much you can obscure your subject and make it tiny, and yet still have it be the subject. And the edge, of course, is right where we want to be. 9</td>', 'wow. this is right on the edge of how much you can obscure your subject and make it tiny, and yet still have it be the subject. And the edge, of course, is right where we want to be. 9', '2007-02-07 23:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
