(3342407, 452891, 34763, '<td valign="top">John a perfect capture, even no footprints in snow. Amazing, perfect angle and shadows have great detail.</td>', 'John a perfect capture, even no footprints in snow. Amazing, perfect angle and shadows have great detail.', '2007-02-08 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3342409, 448570, 63495, '<td valign="top">it looks worthy to me Sandy. isnt it amazing how fog can change how things apear. It made this a lovely spot and you captured it well</td>', 'it looks worthy to me Sandy. isnt it amazing how fog can change how things apear. It made this a lovely spot and you captured it well', '2007-02-08 00:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3342410, 451929, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice entry, Jayson!  I didn''t get back to comment on this in time, but it got an 8 from me.  I kinda favor the grey snow because it makes this look like it''s on an xmas card or in a picture book.  I guess if you really really wanted to, you might have done some real soft dodging  on the snow to bring out the contrasts within.  Or possibly channel mixer might have teased something out.  But really, the grey gives it a nice mood.  I like the composition too!  But you really ought not to keep your wife in a barn ;-)</td>', 'Nice entry, Jayson!  I didn''t get back to comment on this in time, but it got an 8 from me.  I kinda favor the grey snow because it makes this look like it''s on an xmas card or in a picture book.  I guess if you really really wanted to, you might have done some real soft dodging  on the snow to bring out the contrasts within.  Or possibly channel mixer might have teased something out.  But really, the grey gives it a nice mood.  I like the composition too!  But you really ought not to keep your wife in a barn ;-)', '2007-02-08 00:26:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3342412, 452862, 66201, '<td valign="top">Just to say that the sea really is this colour down here at the Point - this jewel turquoise. Our beach sand is also this fine, soft biscuit colour.</td>', 'Just to say that the sea really is this colour down here at the Point - this jewel turquoise. Our beach sand is also this fine, soft biscuit colour.', '2007-02-08 00:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
