(3342545, 462224, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow, Freakin.. I expected this to place in the top 20 or so.  I loved the array of neutrals - you somehow got them to look vibrant!   And the pose and the style and the painterly clarity  - straight out of Today''s Ornithographer. Beautiful job... 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow, Freakin.. I expected this to place in the top 20 or so.  I loved the array of neutrals - you somehow got them to look vibrant!   And the pose and the style and the painterly clarity  - straight out of Today''s Ornithographer. Beautiful job... 10 from me.', '2007-02-08 01:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3342549, 461961, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice top 20 finish, chele! Beautiful image!</td>', 'Nice top 20 finish, chele! Beautiful image!', '2007-02-08 01:07:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3342550, 458986, 30982, '<td valign="top">I actually like the harsh lighting on this alot and would have scored it well.  The dust in the image is a bit distracting and can be removed in post processing.  I also really like the crop and the way the light creates shadows of the lashes in the eye.  Very much underscored in my opinion.</td>', 'I actually like the harsh lighting on this alot and would have scored it well.  The dust in the image is a bit distracting and can be removed in post processing.  I also really like the crop and the way the light creates shadows of the lashes in the eye.  Very much underscored in my opinion.', '2007-02-08 01:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
