(3342695, 457240, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bood:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave it a six as I love found objects and this one is an excellent example.<br/>However, things not in its favour are the panoramic crop - why? Selective colouring is just naff and a better way to present the head would be by moving in and composing the shot with a little more thought given to the background. I dont know what was there though.<br/>The worst thing about the whole picture is the title which is just awful. Why take some crappy overused phrase to present such an interesting subject? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well i appreciate all comments but the reason for the title was that i thought the average person would walk by and wonder what the story was with it...Guess I could have called it "What The ****!?"</td>', 'Originally posted by bood: I gave it a six as I love found objects and this one is an excellent example.However, things not in its favour are the panoramic crop - why? Selective colouring is just naff and a better way to present the head would be by moving in and composing the shot with a little more thought given to the background. I dont know what was there though.The worst thing about the whole picture is the title which is just awful. Why take some crappy overused phrase to present such an interesting subject?   Well i appreciate all comments but the reason for the title was that i thought the average person would walk by and wonder what the story was with it...Guess I could have called it "What The ****!?"', '2007-02-08 02:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
