(3342945, 460618, 41746, '<td valign="top">You know how good you are - you don´t need DPC viewers to tell you. I was really impressed by your portfolio. Great work. Even though people who gave comment on this photo like your angle I think it is mostly the angle that made the image not score higher. Still a great shot!</td>', 'You know how good you are - you don´t need DPC viewers to tell you. I was really impressed by your portfolio. Great work. Even though people who gave comment on this photo like your angle I think it is mostly the angle that made the image not score higher. Still a great shot!', '2007-02-08 04:56:01.000000', NULL, 0),
