(3343022, 462138, 58991, '<td valign="top">A very good image. <br/> <br/>Glæsileg mynd hjá þér. Ég sé að þú hefur farið austar en við, því myndin er tekin sama dag 13 jan. Við enduðum á Skógarfossi.<br/></td>', 'A very good image.  Glæsileg mynd hjá þér. Ég sé að þú hefur farið austar en við, því myndin er tekin sama dag 13 jan. Við enduðum á Skógarfossi.', '2007-02-08 06:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3343026, 459601, 42198, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of colour. It''s let down by the lighting though. Judging from the glare at the centre of the shot you used on-camera flash for this. Try experimenting with natural light from a window (you might need longer shutter speeds).<br/> <br/>Also, it looks like there''s slightly too much sharpening, there''s a halo effect appearing on the neck and around the strings.</td>', 'Good composition and use of colour. It''s let down by the lighting though. Judging from the glare at the centre of the shot you used on-camera flash for this. Try experimenting with natural light from a window (you might need longer shutter speeds). Also, it looks like there''s slightly too much sharpening, there''s a halo effect appearing on the neck and around the strings.', '2007-02-08 06:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
