(3343702, 462170, 19982, '<td valign="top">The top left of the sombrero seems very sharp.  But her eyes ... not so much.  It''s as if you missed the focus, or she moved after you had already locked the focus.  I think better lighting on her face (or a little PS to lighten her up a bit) would have helped (as would whitening her teeth).  Also, getting rid of the object in the bottom right corner.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-08 11:00:40.</i></td>', 'The top left of the sombrero seems very sharp.  But her eyes ... not so much.  It''s as if you missed the focus, or she moved after you had already locked the focus.  I think better lighting on her face (or a little PS to lighten her up a bit) would have helped (as would whitening her teeth).  Also, getting rid of the object in the bottom right corner.', '2007-02-08 11:00:02.000000', '2007-02-08 11:00:40.000000', 0),
