(3344977, 448570, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, serene picture, and definitely unusual for San Antonio!  Very well seen and worth going to work late that morning.  I really like the watercolor effect of the reflections.</td>', 'What a lovely, serene picture, and definitely unusual for San Antonio!  Very well seen and worth going to work late that morning.  I really like the watercolor effect of the reflections.', '2007-02-08 16:09:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3345003, 448570, 47205, '<td valign="top">I really, really like the softness to this Sandy. Fog has an amazing way of making something not very interesting and adding a totally different feel to it; same as your ability to capture something and add interest to it. You did very well my friend...</td>', 'I really, really like the softness to this Sandy. Fog has an amazing way of making something not very interesting and adding a totally different feel to it; same as your ability to capture something and add interest to it. You did very well my friend...', '2007-02-08 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3345021, 462095, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very very nice!  I''m a sucker for good barbed wire fence shots.  Seriously!  And this is a very good one.  Colors are wondermous and the fog is the perfect addition to this.</td>', 'Very very nice!  I''m a sucker for good barbed wire fence shots.  Seriously!  And this is a very good one.  Colors are wondermous and the fog is the perfect addition to this.', '2007-02-08 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3345069, 451571, 30982, '<td valign="top">It is indeed a gorgeous part of the country.  The lower valley may have a tad too much yellow to it for my taste - I find that''s an issue with HDR/tone-mapping using Photomatix, and haven''t yet found a way to get around it.  I do like the view!</td>', 'It is indeed a gorgeous part of the country.  The lower valley may have a tad too much yellow to it for my taste - I find that''s an issue with HDR/tone-mapping using Photomatix, and haven''t yet found a way to get around it.  I do like the view!', '2007-02-08 16:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3345077, 451113, 57060, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible picture, obviously a tremendous amountof work and thought went into making this, I certainly enjoy it. This again is about symmetry as the central point, the trouble is - there really isn''t anyplace to rest your eyes - I keep moving about trying to find a place to focus, but I can''t find it. The eyes are critical as others point out, this is the one place where the symmetry is broken, but becasue they aren''t focused on the viewer they also don''t capture attention. Perhaps another area of symmetry break would have made the difference between a really good shot and a great one - again, all just my opinion. Thanks again for your efforts though, you''ve definately stretched us all a bit.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'This is an incredible picture, obviously a tremendous amountof work and thought went into making this, I certainly enjoy it. This again is about symmetry as the central point, the trouble is - there really isn''t anyplace to rest your eyes - I keep moving about trying to find a place to focus, but I can''t find it. The eyes are critical as others point out, this is the one place where the symmetry is broken, but becasue they aren''t focused on the viewer they also don''t capture attention. Perhaps another area of symmetry break would have made the difference between a really good shot and a great one - again, all just my opinion. Thanks again for your efforts though, you''ve definately stretched us all a bit. Jack', '2007-02-08 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3345080, 451753, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh I do like this.  The toning is very nice and I love the perspective and the lines and angles formed.  The circle in the door is perfect, and the little star of light from under the seat is just wonderful!  Very nice work!</td>', 'Oh I do like this.  The toning is very nice and I love the perspective and the lines and angles formed.  The circle in the door is perfect, and the little star of light from under the seat is just wonderful!  Very nice work!', '2007-02-08 16:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
