(3346158, 460369, 50695, '<td valign="top">Dude, your whites are blown. You cropped off three of the four paws from the forelegs. None of these things matter, but they make people score lower. The important thing is that you captured the personality of both dogs and that both personalities interact in an interesting way. Just to be honest, I only gave this a 6 because I was blowing through these pictures too fast. But that''s still higher than I scored the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Dude, your whites are blown. You cropped off three of the four paws from the forelegs. None of these things matter, but they make people score lower. The important thing is that you captured the personality of both dogs and that both personalities interact in an interesting way. Just to be honest, I only gave this a 6 because I was blowing through these pictures too fast. But that''s still higher than I scored the blue ribbon!', '2007-02-08 22:09:37.000000', NULL, 0),
