(3346167, 459264, 60915, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot, Shanny! So creative! The sand around the frame is a tad distracing though, and I think if you smoothed it out with something, like maybe a watering can? would have improved this heaps. Just a suggestion though and still a fantastic shot:) Love your work!</td>', 'This is an awesome shot, Shanny! So creative! The sand around the frame is a tad distracing though, and I think if you smoothed it out with something, like maybe a watering can? would have improved this heaps. Just a suggestion though and still a fantastic shot:) Love your work!', '2007-02-08 22:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
