(3346591, 459811, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, congrats on this good score! I voted this an 8 but was actually thinking that it would get a very poor score dut to how unusual it was - I''m very pleased that it didn''t. I think the beautiful composition and the parallel lines really made this image work. Congrats again.</td>', 'Wow, congrats on this good score! I voted this an 8 but was actually thinking that it would get a very poor score dut to how unusual it was - I''m very pleased that it didn''t. I think the beautiful composition and the parallel lines really made this image work. Congrats again.', '2007-02-09 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
