(3347997, 461490, 33535, '<td valign="top"><i>I am just getting started with this type of photography and will continue submitting stuff like this as it is my new favorite type of photography, or what I call "nightscape" photos as in Night-Landscape. If you start to get sick of it, just vote it down, won´t make me stop though :) </i> <br/> <br/>yeah, since i''m here in iceland, i''m taking 80% of my photos after sunset, too and i love it. yesterday i went on a hill at 5am to try to take a 360 degrees panorama of the landscape lit by the moon, all the people here think i''m crazy...lol<br/> <br/>amazing shot, i´d really like to join you on one of your next night excursions...;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-09 15:10:56.</i></td>', 'I am just getting started with this type of photography and will continue submitting stuff like this as it is my new favorite type of photography, or what I call "nightscape" photos as in Night-Landscape. If you start to get sick of it, just vote it down, won´t make me stop though :)   yeah, since i''m here in iceland, i''m taking 80% of my photos after sunset, too and i love it. yesterday i went on a hill at 5am to try to take a 360 degrees panorama of the landscape lit by the moon, all the people here think i''m crazy...lol amazing shot, i´d really like to join you on one of your next night excursions...;)', '2007-02-09 15:07:55.000000', '2007-02-09 15:10:56.000000', 0),
