(3348431, 456469, 69317, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Yeah, I always wondered how important the "camera" is in winning a challenge anyway. I have a F717 myself, and all the talk about high-end cameras makes me ask - why? The "photographer" and "his/her" unique viewpoint is probably the most important thing in a picture.</td>', 'Congrats! Yeah, I always wondered how important the "camera" is in winning a challenge anyway. I have a F717 myself, and all the talk about high-end cameras makes me ask - why? The "photographer" and "his/her" unique viewpoint is probably the most important thing in a picture.', '2007-02-09 17:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
