(3358907, 462240, 55838, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA!!  I was just looking back on some of the comments I''ve made to revisit pic''s post challenge and I ran accross my comment of "+" on this pic.  Thank you for graciously marking it as helpful.  I often vote with my two year old daughter on my lap and she loves the keyboard!  I try to pay attention but it looks like one of her "comments" got by me!  You must have been wondering what on earth "+" meant - at any rate it beats "-" right? : ) Very nice color and idea for your shot!  Thanks again &amp; sorry!</td>', 'HAHAHA!!  I was just looking back on some of the comments I''ve made to revisit pic''s post challenge and I ran accross my comment of "+" on this pic.  Thank you for graciously marking it as helpful.  I often vote with my two year old daughter on my lap and she loves the keyboard!  I try to pay attention but it looks like one of her "comments" got by me!  You must have been wondering what on earth "+" meant - at any rate it beats "-" right? : ) Very nice color and idea for your shot!  Thanks again & sorry!', '2007-02-12 20:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
