(3362837, 451929, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jayson,<br/> <br/>I am a fan of simplicity that is technically well done, and think you succeeded quite nicely with this. I was one of your higher scores (7). I know in your comments you mentioned lack of pure white, but I see some whites in the rooftop and small area of the sky on my monitor. In fact, this seems like a very well metered shot to me, and we all know how trick snow is!<br/> <br/>The one thing that seems problematic is the horizon - I think it may be a tad skewed to the left. <br/></td>', 'Jayson, I am a fan of simplicity that is technically well done, and think you succeeded quite nicely with this. I was one of your higher scores (7). I know in your comments you mentioned lack of pure white, but I see some whites in the rooftop and small area of the sky on my monitor. In fact, this seems like a very well metered shot to me, and we all know how trick snow is! The one thing that seems problematic is the horizon - I think it may be a tad skewed to the left. ', '2007-02-13 22:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
