(3376545, 459494, 60770, '<td valign="top">I think merging two exposures could have helped here to bring higher quality to the bottle. The highlight on the bottom and the distortion on the bottle detract from the wonderful quality of the shot. I love the effect of the lighting, is the light under the bottle?</td>', 'I think merging two exposures could have helped here to bring higher quality to the bottle. The highlight on the bottom and the distortion on the bottle detract from the wonderful quality of the shot. I love the effect of the lighting, is the light under the bottle?', '2007-02-17 22:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3376573, 461939, 60770, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture, but I think it may need greater range in the tree and boy. They''re pushing being silhouettes and, from what I''ve seen, people on the site really like more range. I like it, but the silhouetting that may be part of why it scored low.</td>', 'I really like the picture, but I think it may need greater range in the tree and boy. They''re pushing being silhouettes and, from what I''ve seen, people on the site really like more range. I like it, but the silhouetting that may be part of why it scored low.', '2007-02-17 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 0),
