(3378717, 461532, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to commend you - it took a pair to enter this shot. Of jeans, that is :-) That aside, I''m not sure what emotion you were aiming to convey. Although the act itself would be interpreted by many as sexy, the feeling is more utilitarian. Which maybe was your point. Fingers look a little oversharpened on my screen, but the focus is dead on. Interesting entry!</td>', 'I''ve got to commend you - it took a pair to enter this shot. Of jeans, that is :-) That aside, I''m not sure what emotion you were aiming to convey. Although the act itself would be interpreted by many as sexy, the feeling is more utilitarian. Which maybe was your point. Fingers look a little oversharpened on my screen, but the focus is dead on. Interesting entry!', '2007-02-18 19:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3378727, 462137, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the long exposure and whites. The icicles add an interesting element to this shot as well. The only thing I wish is that there were more of a total focal point - I''d really like to see the area where the water spills over the top of the cliff. Nice job, though, especially with a tough subject.</td>', 'Nice job with the long exposure and whites. The icicles add an interesting element to this shot as well. The only thing I wish is that there were more of a total focal point - I''d really like to see the area where the water spills over the top of the cliff. Nice job, though, especially with a tough subject.', '2007-02-18 20:02:14.000000', NULL, 0),
