(3392853, 453966, 24111, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cpanaioti:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe never used neat image, however all the detail has been processed out of the skin.  This is the classic result of too much neat image.  You seem to have come up with different processing which produces the same result. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are obviously not a fan of digital art editing, if you were, you would know that this is NOT the result of Neat Image nor resembles it in anyway, ..Thank you..</td>', 'Originally posted by cpanaioti: Maybe never used neat image, however all the detail has been processed out of the skin.  This is the classic result of too much neat image.  You seem to have come up with different processing which produces the same result.   You are obviously not a fan of digital art editing, if you were, you would know that this is NOT the result of Neat Image nor resembles it in anyway, ..Thank you..', '2007-02-22 07:36:59.000000', NULL, 0),
