(3393496, 457541, 30861, '<td valign="top">Jeff,<br/> <br/>this is a moody shot with a lot of potential, much of it unrealized. The composition is an issue, because it is very static, with the lighthouse too centered for the powerful, turbulent context of the image. It''s also very fuzzy-looking. There doesn''t seem to be much you can do about that, but you CAN reframe the image if you like to give more dynamic power to the composition, something like this... I have also added in some USM and adjusted the levels for more pop.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=473379" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/473379.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/473379.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/473379.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Robt.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-22 11:35:46.</i></td>', 'Jeff, this is a moody shot with a lot of potential, much of it unrealized. The composition is an issue, because it is very static, with the lighthouse too centered for the powerful, turbulent context of the image. It''s also very fuzzy-looking. There doesn''t seem to be much you can do about that, but you CAN reframe the image if you like to give more dynamic power to the composition, something like this... I have also added in some USM and adjusted the levels for more pop.   Robt.', '2007-02-22 11:34:07.000000', '2007-02-22 11:35:46.000000', 0),
