(3414238, 461822, 29011, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of this wonderfully cute baby. I didn''t find the eye being covered a distraction at all. Actually find the tilt of the hat adds charm to the shot. Also like the pastel color theme. The colors are just right for the shot and and do not scream look at me. The baby afterall is the object of interest and affection here. Thought this one should score higher. There is some noise near the edges of the hat and baby''s shoulder, so maybe that put some voters off? I have no idea. Only thing I would change, which is ever soo minute , which doesn''t make a big difference, is to clone out the little spot on the baby''s left shoulder.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-28 14:38:42.</i></td>', 'Excellent capture of this wonderfully cute baby. I didn''t find the eye being covered a distraction at all. Actually find the tilt of the hat adds charm to the shot. Also like the pastel color theme. The colors are just right for the shot and and do not scream look at me. The baby afterall is the object of interest and affection here. Thought this one should score higher. There is some noise near the edges of the hat and baby''s shoulder, so maybe that put some voters off? I have no idea. Only thing I would change, which is ever soo minute , which doesn''t make a big difference, is to clone out the little spot on the baby''s left shoulder.', '2007-02-28 14:38:10.000000', '2007-02-28 14:38:42.000000', 0),
(3414257, 460145, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the lighting. Great job with the background gradient lighting effect. As a test shot I think it''s ok. This lighting setup has some great uses ahead :)<br/>Shot as is, I only find the hint of the table surface visible behind the model the only distraction.</td>', 'Really like the lighting. Great job with the background gradient lighting effect. As a test shot I think it''s ok. This lighting setup has some great uses ahead :)Shot as is, I only find the hint of the table surface visible behind the model the only distraction.', '2007-02-28 14:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3414327, 460191, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice control of the DOF. The composition looks great. Would only suggest some darkening of the corners. Should make the eye wander less around the photo to put more focus on the queen and circle of the other chess pieces.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-28 15:03:46.</i></td>', 'Very nice control of the DOF. The composition looks great. Would only suggest some darkening of the corners. Should make the eye wander less around the photo to put more focus on the queen and circle of the other chess pieces.', '2007-02-28 15:03:27.000000', '2007-02-28 15:03:46.000000', 0),
