(3426746, 448570, 67145, '<td valign="top">beautiful photograph sandy ... and fog/mist is one of my favourite things in nature to shoot ... we''ve been getting quite a lot lately so i''m stoked ...  but by the time you can actually shoot it without a tripod you dont have very long to photograph it and then its burned off ...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-03 23:16:22.</i></td>', 'beautiful photograph sandy ... and fog/mist is one of my favourite things in nature to shoot ... we''ve been getting quite a lot lately so i''m stoked ...  but by the time you can actually shoot it without a tripod you dont have very long to photograph it and then its burned off ...', '2007-03-03 23:15:22.000000', '2007-03-03 23:16:22.000000', 0),
